use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(1770.6,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\"> </text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2370.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2759.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"67\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-67\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3259.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></td>\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">IV.</td>\n    <td class=\"tg-c3ow\">Occupies 11.4 L volume of STP</td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></p>\n<p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>",
